  "title": "Growth agency or in-house team: choosing the right mix | Fyntix",
  "description": "Decide which marketing responsibilities belong inside your business and where specialist agency support can add useful capacity.",
  "classes": "page-shell w-full relative min-h-screen pointer-events-auto",
  "sections": [
